'''''Prunella laciniata''''', the '''cutleaf selfheal''',<ref>{{PLANTS|id=PRLA7|taxon=Prunella laciniata|access-date=14 October 2015}}</ref> is a [[plant]] in the family [[Lamiaceae]].

Sometimes it hybridises with ''[[Prunella vulgaris|P. vulgaris]]'', the result being ''[[Prunella × intermedia|P. × intermedia]]''; other times with ''[[Prunella grandiflora|P. grandiflora]]'', the result being ''[[Prunella × dissecta|P. × dissecta]]''.<ref>{{cite journal |date=2015-03-03 |first1=Vedran |last1=Šegota |first2=Antun |last2=Alegro |first3=Anja |last3=Rimac |first4=Renata |last4=Šoštarić |first5=Zorana |last5=Sedlar |first6=Ljiljana |last6=Borovečki-Voska |first7=Behija |last7=Salkić |title=Nova nalazišta hibrida roda Prunella L. u Hrvatskoj |pages=4–6 |url=https://hrcak.srce.hr/135730 |journal=Glasnik Hrvatskog botaničkog društva |eissn=1848-8102 |volume=3 |issue=1 |language=hr |trans-title=New Find Sites of Hybrids of the Genus Prunella L. in Croatia}}</ref>

